docs/controls.md:22:The controls use the board-code and snapshot formats defined in [Reproducibility](reproducibility.md). A board code starts a deal. A snapshot loads progress on a deal.
docs/controls.md:34:- C07 - Label the textarea "Snapshot JSON" and limit it to 65536 characters. The parser also applies the UTF-8 byte limit in the snapshot format.
docs/controls.md:36:- C08 - Label the export button "Export snapshot". Fill the textarea with readable snapshot JSON. Use version 2 for a named game and version 1 for an unnamed game. You can select and copy manually. Export leaves the game state and clock unchanged. It requires no Clipboard API.
docs/controls.md:40:- C09 - Label the import button "Load snapshot". Validate the complete draft before replacing the current game. Load unfinished progress paused and show "Loaded snapshot. Select Resume to continue." Load completed progress as completed without pausing and show "Loaded completed snapshot."
